    "wake-of-gods.mapobjects.new-chest-i.dialog.trap.disease": "{Treasure Chest}\n\nWhen you open the chest, gas pours out - it's trapped! Your troops breathed some gas, and feel ill. Hopefully it will wear off soon.\n\nAfter the gas clears, you look in the chest, and find two artifacts!\n\nThe effects of the gas will afflict your troops in the next battle.",
    "wake-of-gods.mapobjects.new-chest-i.dialog.trap.poison": "{Treasure Chest}\n\nWhen you open the chest, gas pours out - it's trapped! Your troops breathed some gas, and feel poisoned. Hopefully it will wear off soon.\n\nAfter the gas clears, you look in the chest, and find two artifacts!\n\nThe effects of the gas will afflict your troops in the next battle.",
    "wake-of-gods.mapobjects.new-chest-i.dialog.trap.weakness": "{Treasure Chest}\n\nWhen you open the chest, gas pours out - it's trapped! Your troops breathed some gas, and feel weak. Hopefully it will wear off soon.\n\nAfter the gas clears, you look in the chest, and find two artifacts!\n\nThe effects of the gas will afflict your troops in the next battle.",
    "wake-of-gods.mapobjects.new-chest-i.dialog.trap.slow": "{Treasure Chest}\n\nWhen you open the chest, gas pours out - it's trapped! Your troops breathed some gas, and feel lethargic. Hopefully it will wear off soon.\n\nAfter the gas clears, you look in the chest, and find two artifacts!\n\nThe effects of the gas will afflict your troops in the next battle.",
    "wake-of-gods.mapobjects.new-chest-i.dialog.trap.safe10": "{Treasure Chest}\n\nWhen you open the chest, gas pours out - it's trapped! Fortunately, you suspected something was up, and avoid harm.\n\nAfter the gas clears, you look in the chest, and find two artifacts!",
    "wake-of-gods.mapobjects.new-chest-i.dialog.trap.safe11": "{Treasure Chest}\n\nWhen you open the chest, gas pours out - it's trapped! Luckily, you and your troops are unharmed.\n\nAfter the gas clears, you look in the chest, and find two artifacts!",
